Recueil des Traités_______275\nAGREEMENT1 BETWEEN JAPAN AND THE UNITED STATES \nOF AMERICA CONCERNING THE RYUKYU ISLANDS \nAND THE DAITO ISLANDS\nJapan and the United States of America,\nNoting that the Prime Minister of Japan and the President of the United \nStates of America reviewed together on November 19,20 and 21,1969 the status \nof the Ryukyu Islands and the Daito Islands, referred to as \" Okinawa \" in the \nJoint Communiqu  between the Prime Minister and the President issued on \nNovember 21,1969, and agreed that the Government of Japan and the Govern \nment of the United States of America should enter immediately into consulta \ntions regarding the specific arrangements for accomplishing the early reversion \nof these islands to Japan ;\nNoting that the two Governments have conducted such consultations and \nhave reaffirmed that the reversion of these islands to Japan be carried out on \nthe basis of the said Joint Com","path":"jobs/opus-media-match/output/text/e08728ab2ab8348bb810a259c26d598bdd18e642521aa6edc9ba7346a27cf068.txt","sha256":"d4ccb9ed7562b0afa4992708b6988c9d651920e8217bf7eea3da24573659f66b","source":{"line":495,"path":"jobs/opus-media-match/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"ab3b64f49ea7d11de44403dc14f691efae02befdb2bd28407b86f8e633a706e4"}},{"first_1500_characters":"Wanted: EO::10713\nCited by: EO:10713, EO:11010, EO:11263, EO:11326, EO:11395, EO:11618\nSource: https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1957-06-07/pdf/FR-1957-06-07.pdf\nSHA-256 of the downloaded file: e6c677193ab33cf3cb3e510f946780409dcd55b77e6235d4e19c8a5a939d3af6\nLocation: 22 FR 4007, PDF pages 1-4\nMachine-extracted text (from a scan's text layer for older documents). Not an authenticated transcription; check the PDF.\n\n=== PDF page 1 of 40 ===\nVOLUME 22 NUMBER 110\nWashington, Friday, June 7, 1957\nTITLE 3— THE PRESIDENT\nEXECUTIVE ORDER 10713\nProviding for A dministration  of  the  \nR y u k y u I slands\nWHEREAS under Article 3 of the \nTreaty of Peace with Japan the United \nStates is exercising all and any powers \nof administration, legislation and juris­\ndiction over the territory, including ter­\nritorial waters, and inhabitants of the \nRyukyu Islands (the term “Ryukyu Is­\nlands,” as used in this order, meaning \nNansei Shoto south of 29° north latitude, \nexcluding the islands in the Amami \nOshima group with respect to which all \nrights and interests of the United States \nunder the said Article of the Treaty have \nbeen relinquished to Japan) :\nN O W , THEREFORE, by virtue of the \nauthority vested in me by the Constitu­\ntion, and as President of the United \nStates and Commander-in-Chief of the \narmed forces of the United States, it is \nordered as follows:\nSection 1. Except as the Congress may \notherwise provide by law with respect to \nthe government of the Ryukyu Islands, \nall ad","path":"jobs/source-ladder/output/texts/EO_10713_585b72cbd3.txt","sha256":"6d39f9c6b7a1fbe35e1471ecbb7ba55e34b08b2cbdfbfa6f039eb538667cae52","source":{"line":13,"path":"jobs/source-ladder/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"e9ef73e01c664b29734a444acb1a1753126a62b2e4a9e0b7e551266d370dff69"}}]}
